BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 794.0 Td (1. RESEARCH -- Ask questions, don't jump into code. "Do not start work yet.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 781.4 Td (2. PLAN -- File-level decomposition. Tasks of 2-5 min each. Checkpoint: approve the plan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 768.8 Td (3. EXECUTE -- One subagent per task. Orchestrator coordinates, never implements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 756.2 Td (4. REVIEW -- Spec compliance + code quality. Two separate subagents. Then human review.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 743.6 Td (5. VERIFY -- Run ALL tests. Check against original spec. 3 random regression features.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 731.0 Td (6. SHIP -- PR via GitHub MCP, linked to Jira, Slack notification. Clean up worktree.) Tj ET
